  {%- comment -%}
    Failover simulator. Three tabs, each stating plainly what keeps
    working and what stops — including the fact that camera streams are
    Wi-Fi only and are lost in both outage scenarios, SIM or no SIM.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pv-section">
    <div class="pv-wrap">
      <div class="pv-contents__head pv-reveal">
        <span class="pv-eyebrow pe-eyebrow--amber">Continuité de service</span>
        <h2>Que se passe-t-il exactement quand quelque chose tombe ?</h2>
        <p>Trois scénarios, et à chaque fois ce qui continue de fonctionner — et ce qui s'arrête.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pe-sim pv-reveal">
        <div class="pe-sim__tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Scénarios de panne">
          <button class="pe-sim__tab" role="tab" id="PETab1-{{ section.id }}" aria-controls="PEPan1-{{ section.id }}" aria-selected="true" type="button">
            <span class="pe-sim__tab-k">Situation normale</span>
            <span class="pe-sim__tab-t">Tout fonctionne</span>
          </button>
          <button class="pe-sim__tab" role="tab" id="PETab2-{{ section.id }}" aria-controls="PEPan2-{{ section.id }}" aria-selected="false" type="button">
            <span class="pe-sim__tab-k">Panne n° 1</span>
            <span class="pe-sim__tab-t">La box Internet tombe</span>
          </button>
          <button class="pe-sim__tab" role="tab" id="PETab3-{{ section.id }}" aria-controls="PEPan3-{{ section.id }}" aria-selected="false" type="button">
            <span class="pe-sim__tab-k">Panne n° 2</span>
            <span class="pe-sim__tab-t">Coupure de courant</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="pe-sim__body" role="tabpanel" id="PEPan1-{{ section.id }}" aria-labelledby="PETab1-{{ section.id }}">
          <div>
            <p class="pe-sim__state">La centrale est reliée à votre box <strong>en RJ45</strong>, la liaison la plus stable. Le Wi-Fi reste configuré en second, les caméras s'y connectent, et les 9 capteurs Zigbee dialoguent avec la centrale sur leur propre réseau maillé.</p>
            <div class="pe-sim__cols">
              <div class="pe-sim__col pe-sim__col--ok">
                <h3>Ce qui marche</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Alarme, sirènes et capteurs</li>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Notifications sur votre téléphone</li>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Flux vidéo en direct des deux caméras</li>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Scénarios domotique Zigbee</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="pe-sim__col pe-sim__col--ko">
                <h3>Ce qui s'arrête</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>Rien.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pe-sim__diagram">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 320 210" role="img" aria-label="Schéma : la centrale est reliée à la box en Ethernet, l'application est joignable, les capteurs communiquent en Zigbee">
              <rect x="8" y="14" width="96" height="40" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#d2d2d7"></rect>
              <text x="56" y="32" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#1d1d1f">Box Internet</text>
              <text x="56" y="46" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9.5" fill="#037e05">en service</text>
              <rect x="112" y="80" width="96" height="48" rx="10" fill="#12100c"></rect>
              <text x="160" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#ffffff">Centrale</text>
              <text x="160" y="115" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#c8a96e">PA501Z</text>
              <rect x="216" y="14" width="96" height="40" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#d2d2d7"></rect>
              <text x="264" y="32" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#1d1d1f">Application</text>
              <text x="264" y="46" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9.5" fill="#037e05">+ caméras</text>
              <path d="M56 54 L56 104 L112 104" fill="none" stroke="#1f6f3f" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
              <text x="62" y="78" font-size="9.5" fill="#1f6f3f">RJ45</text>
              <path d="M208 104 L264 104 L264 54" fill="none" stroke="#1f6f3f" stroke-width="2.5"></path>
              <circle cx="40" cy="170" r="15" fill="#f3efff" stroke="#6d4fd1"></circle>
              <circle cx="110" cy="188" r="15" fill="#f3efff" stroke="#6d4fd1"></circle>
              <circle cx="186" cy="182" r="15" fill="#f3efff" stroke="#6d4fd1"></circle>
              <circle cx="262" cy="166" r="15" fill="#f3efff" stroke="#6d4fd1"></circle>
              <path d="M40 155 L140 128 M110 173 L150 128 M186 167 L172 128 M262 151 L190 124 M55 168 L95 185 M125 186 L171 182 M201 178 L247 170" fill="none" stroke="#6d4fd1" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></path>
              <text x="160" y="146" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9.5" fill="#3d2a86">maillage Zigbee — 9 capteurs</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pe-sim__body" role="tabpanel" id="PEPan2-{{ section.id }}" aria-labelledby="PETab2-{{ section.id }}" hidden>
          <div>
            <p class="pe-sim__state">Plus de box : ni RJ45, ni Wi-Fi. <strong>Si une carte SIM M2M est installée</strong>, la centrale bascule seule sur les données mobiles 4G+ et l'application reste utilisable. C'est la différence de l'Élite : vous gardez la main, au lieu d'attendre passivement une alerte.</p>
            <div class="pe-sim__cols">
              <div class="pe-sim__col pe-sim__col--ok">
                <h3>Ce qui marche</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Alarme, sirènes et capteurs Zigbee</li>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Application : armer, désarmer, consulter l'historique</li>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Alertes d'intrusion par notification, SMS et appel</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="pe-sim__col pe-sim__col--ko">
                <h3>Ce qui s'arrête</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>Le flux vidéo des caméras : elles fonctionnent uniquement en Wi-Fi, carte SIM ou non</li>
                  <li><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>Sans carte SIM : plus aucune remontée vers l'extérieur, la sirène fonctionne toujours</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
